  {
   "id": "uncertainty",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2750,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### Uncertainty<br><br>- Mechanisms come largely from animal preparations<br>- Heritability is a population statistic<br>- Group imaging differences are not individual tests"
  },
  {
   "id": "hypothesis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 2750,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### Open questions<br><br>- How much of circuit behaviour depends on glial signalling?<br>- What cellular changes produce a measured thickness difference?<br>- How do channel distributions differ between cell types in ways that change signalling?"
  },
